<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Amylin Q1 view adjusted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Amylin Q1 view adjusted.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Thursday it changed its Q1 estimate on Amylin Pharmaceuticals Inc to a loss of $0.34 per share from a loss of $0.53.</p>
<p>--It said the action follows Johnson &amp; Johnson's exercise of an option to expand its collaboration with Amylin to include new versions of pramlintide for treating diabetes, obesity and other indications. Johnson &amp; Johnson paid $6 million to Amylin for these additional rights</p>
<p>--Amylin was up 1/4 at 13-3/4.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
